      <p begin="00:31.870" end="00:33.370" ttm:agent="v1">I don't mean no offense</p>
      <p begin="00:33.130" end="00:34.630" ttm:agent="v1">But shawty what it do</p>
      <p begin="00:34.280" end="00:35.780" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me bout you</p>
      <p begin="00:35.320" end="00:37.420" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me what's old yeah tell me what's new</p>
      <p begin="00:37.420" end="00:39.410" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me what's trash yeah tell me what's cool</p>
      <p begin="00:39.410" end="00:41.540" ttm:agent="v1">I just really want a chance if I'm gonn' be true</p>
      <p begin="00:41.540" end="00:43.690" ttm:agent="v1">I know you stay alone yeah so let me come through</p>
      <p begin="00:43.690" end="00:46.000" ttm:agent="v1">If they ask who on the phone yeah you better say who</p>
      <p begin="00:46.000" end="00:47.700" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, you better say who</p>
      <p begin="00:47.700" end="00:50.300" ttm:agent="v1">If they ask who on the phone yeah you better say who</p>
      <p begin="00:50.300" end="00:52.740" ttm:agent="v1">Double G on me love that's game over</p>
      <p begin="00:52.740" end="00:54.810" ttm:agent="v1">They bad luck I'm a four leaf clover</p>
      <p begin="00:54.810" end="00:56.880" ttm:agent="v1">Got good game long range like rover</p>
      <p begin="00:56.880" end="00:58.970" ttm:agent="v1">Not hood made but I stay with soldiers</p>
      <p begin="00:58.970" end="01:00.470" ttm:agent="v1">God</p>
      <p begin="00:59.520" end="01:01.020" ttm:agent="v1">Damn</p>
      <p begin="01:00.010" end="01:01.510" ttm:agent="v1">The denim is fitted</p>
      <p begin="01:01.100" end="01:03.100" ttm:agent="v1">Can't say that you're with me but I am still wit it</p>
      <p begin="01:03.100" end="01:05.210" ttm:agent="v1">I know that I'm tied up but I am not trippin'</p>
      <p begin="01:05.210" end="01:13.210" ttm:agent="v1">I know that I'm tied up but I am not trippin'</p>
